Description: Karyora Core — the Unified AI Work Platform desktop product (uawp)
 Local-mode AI work platform core; the binary is self-contained
 (the CGO-linked SQLite engine ships inside it — zero runtime
 prerequisites, D-07). User data lives at OS-standard user
 application-data locations and is NEVER touched by install, upgrade
 or uninstall (C5-15 §5.0). UNSIGNED: repo metadata and package
 signatures are the BLOCKED release-day stage (C5-13 §9.2).
